bzip2 1.0.8 library (BSD-style, see LICENSE), for importing natural voices
packed as .tar.bz2 (sherpa-onnx's voice archives; android/jni/jni/bzip2Stream.c).
Upstream sourceware.org/pub/bzip2/bzip2-1.0.8.tar.gz (sha256
ab5a03176ee106d3f0fa90e381da478ddae405918153cca248e682cd0c4a2269),
these library files unchanged; built with BZ_NO_STDIO. Only decompression is
reached; the linker drops the rest.
